Cyberboss Enhanced — upstream attribution and modification notice

This repository is an independent derivative of Cyberboss:
https://github.com/WenXiaoWendy/cyberboss

It is not a GitHub network fork. It has a separate, privacy-sanitized
publication history so that source code can be shared without publishing
runtime accounts, conversations, personal records, or local credentials.

This modified version was first publicly released on 2026-09-07. Its
substantive changes include reliable WeChat outbound delivery, persistent
background-event routing, reminder and task reconciliation, runtime recovery,
privacy-safe configuration loading, and publication-safety tooling.

